The `concurrency-bugs` directory does not vendor the original benchmark
sources. The benchmark programs built from this directory are downloaded from
their respective upstream archives at configure/build time.

Accordingly:

- the licenses of those downloaded upstream sources apply to the benchmark
  source trees themselves;
- this directory only contains local CMake glue, configuration templates, and
  patch files used to build or adapt those external benchmarks within
  Benchamel.

Each downloaded benchmark keeps its own upstream licensing terms.
